==Event Information==
Time to celebrate {{Color|#FF0000|'''Four Years'''}} of Battle Cats awesomeness!<br>
Tons of special events, sales, and challenges for you to enjoy!<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''On between September 17th (11am) and October 1st (11:59pm)!'''}}

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● An exclusive hero, only for The Battle Cats English version!'''}}<br>
Collect a unique Uber Rare Cat, only available during this celebration campaign in the Best of the Best Rare Capsule Set!

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Platinum Tickets on sale!'''}}<br>
Between {{Color|#FF00CC|'''September 17 (11:00am) and September 22 (11:59pm)'''}}, pick up tickets to use at the Platinum Capsules!<br>
Each ticket used will give you a 100% chance of drawing an Uber Rare Cat!<br>
This rare offer will only be here for a short time, so don't miss out!<br>
<small><small>※Each user will only be able to purchase one Platinum Ticket during this campaign.<br>
※If Platinum Tickets do not appear, please update to the most recent version of The Battle Cats and reboot the app.<br>
※Seasonal Event Cats, Collab Event Cats, and Girls & Monsters Cats are not available from this Platinum Capsule set.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Everyone gets a First-Time Rare Draw Discount!'''}}<br>
Starting {{Color|#FF00CC|'''9/21'''}}, all players will receive a discount on their first try at a Rare Capsule draw!<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''One Single Draw'''}} will cost just {{Color|#FF00CC|'''30 Cat Food'''}} instead of the normal 150 Cat Food!<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''One 11-Capsule Draw'''}} will cost just {{Color|#FF00CC|'''750 Cat Food'''}} instead of the normal 1500 Cat Food!<br>
<small><small>※ If this offer does not appear, please update to the most recent version of The Battle Cats and reboot the app.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Half-Off Cat Food costs to unlock Special Cats!'''}}<br>
Build up your army by recruiting the Special Cats!<br>
Only during the event times below, you can unlock non-event Special Cats at the Upgrade Menu for 50% of the normal cost!<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''Special Cat Sale #1：September 21st (11am) thru 24th (10:59am)'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''Special Cat Sale #2：September 28th (11am) thru October 1st (10:59am)'''}}

Don't miss this chance to complete your Cat collection!

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● English Version Only Special Stages!'''}}<br>
・Head to the {{Color|#FF0000|'''Birthday Present!'''}} map for a special Score Stage challenge! Max out your score to collect tons of tickets and other awesome rewards!<br>
・Take on the limited edition stage {{Color|#FF00CC|'''Minced Meet-Up'''}}, and collect the English version-only unit [[Catburger (Special Cat)|{{Color|#FF00CC|'''Catburger'''}}]]!<br>
Then visit Stories of Legend/Event Stages during this event to take on the limited awakening stage {{Color|#FF0000|'''"Catburger Awakens!"'''}} for a chance to claim the power of {{Color|#FF0000|'''Catburger's third form'''}}!<br>
<small><small>※ Upgrade Catburger to level 20 to reveal the Evolve option in the Upgrade screen!<br>
※ If you have not collected Catburger, you can still collect its third form as a drop reward and use it once you meet the Evolve conditions.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Catamin/Catfruit Limited Capsule Events!'''}}<br>
At the Capsule Menu, tap the buttons at top left to switch between standard Capsule events and the {{Color|#FF0000|'''Catfruit Limited Capsules'''}} & {{Color|#FF0000|'''Catseye Limited Capsules'''}}!<br>
Speed up your Gamatoto! Power up your Cats! Don't miss out on these cool items!<br>
・{{Color|#FF00CC|'''Catfruit Limited Capsules'''}}: September 17th (11am) thru 24th (10:59am)<br>
・{{Color|#FF00CC|'''Catseye Limited Capsules'''}}: September 24th (11am) thru October 1st (10:59am)<br>
<small><small>※The Catfruit Limited Capsules provide Catfruit and XP rewards, while Catseye Limited Capsules will provide Catseyes and XP!<br>
※Catfruit Limited Capsules will appear after Empire of Cats Ch. 3 is completed in The Battle Cats, while Catseye Limited Capsules appear after User Rank 1600 is reached!</small></small>

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''●Limited GAMATOTO Expedition Areas'''}}<br>
Only during this event, you can send your Gamatoto adventurer to the limited areas {{Color|#1ECCFF|'''Cats Eye Cave'''}} and {{Color|#1ECCFF|'''XP Harvest'''}} for a special set of Cats Eye rewards!<br>
Get as many Cats Eyes as you can and help your units break through to even higher levels!<br>
Don't miss this special chance!<br>
・{{Color|#FF00CC|'''XP Harvest'''}}: September 15th (11am) thru 24th (10:59am)<br>
・{{Color|#FF00CC|'''Cats Eye Cave'''}}: September 24th (11am) thru October 1st (10:59am)

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Builder's Blitz!'''}}<br>
Build up your Cat Base with the Ototo Corps by collecting materials at these special stages!<br>
Get building materials at the Special Stages {{Color|#FF00CC|'''Cavern of Comets, Island of Ash, Strait of Wings,'''}} appearing at the times below!<br>
2:00pm ～ 4:00pm　6:00pm ～ 8:00pm

Take on these challenges each day and build up your building stockpiles!<br>
<small><small>※ {{Color|#FF00CC|'''Cavern of Comets'''}} provides Bricks and Meteorites.<br>
※ {{Color|#FF00CC|'''Island of Ash'''}} provides Coal and Beast Bones.<br>
※ {{Color|#FF00CC|'''Strait of Wings'''}} provides Feathers, Gears, and Gold.<br>
※ Stages appear after Empire of Cats Ch. 1 has been cleared.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Treasure Festivals'''}}<br>
Everyday from {{Color|#FF00CC|'''12:00pm to 11:59pm'''}} during this event, {{Color|#FF6D01|'''double your chance to pick up treasure'''}} in Battle Cats story modes!<br>
{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''On even days (9/18, 9/20, 9/22, 9/24, 9/26, 9/28, 9/30)'''}} challenge {{Color|#FF00CC|'''Empire of Cats'''}} for this benefit, and on {{Color|#008000|'''odd days (9/17, 9/19, 9/21, 9/23, 9/25, 9/27, 9/29)'''}} take on Into the Future for extra-high drop rates!

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''●Half-off energy for Empire of Cats, Into the Future, and Stories of Legend!'''}}<br>
Every day from {{Color|#FF00CC|'''18:00am～22:00am'''}}, stages from {{Color|#008000|'''Empire of Cats'''}}, {{Color|#1ECCFF|'''Into the Future'''}}, or {{Color|#FF0000|'''Stories of Legend'''}} stages will be available at half the energy cost!<br>
Check out the dates below to see when you can double your Battle Cats fun!<br>
{{Color|#008000|'''・Empire of Cats: 9/17, 9/20, 9/23, 9/26, 9/29'''}}<br>
{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''・Into the Future: 9/18, 9/21, 9/24, 9/27, 9/30'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''・Stories of Legend: 9/19, 9/22, 9/25, 9/28'''}}

Don't miss this awesome opportunity to clear tons of stages!<br>
<small><small>※ Clear Empire of Cats Ch. 1 to receive this Half-Off Energy benefit.<br>
※ If this event does not appear, please update to the most recent version of The Battle Cats and reboot the app.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''●Awesome Rewards Everyday!'''}}
{{Color|#008000|'''Between September 17th and 24th'''}}, every day you visit the Cat Base you will be rewarded with a {{Color|#FF00CC|'''30 Cat Food'''}} present!<br>
Then, {{Color|#008000|'''between September 25th and October 1st'''}} event-only login stamps will unlock more rewards for each day you visit the Cat Base!<br>
Play every day and don't miss out on these free gifts!

